## Scenarios

### tree depth numeric guard

#### defaults malformed depth values

- Verify: defaults malformed depth values
   - Expected: parse_tree_depth_or_default("", 3) equals `3`
   - Expected: parse_tree_depth_or_default("abc", 5) equals `5`
   - Expected: parse_tree_depth_or_default("12x", 7) equals `7`
   - Expected: parse_tree_depth_or_default("-4", 9) equals `9`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 6 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-APP-TREE-001
step("Verify: defaults malformed depth values")
expect(parse_tree_depth_or_default("", 3)).to_equal(3)
expect(parse_tree_depth_or_default("abc", 5)).to_equal(5)
expect(parse_tree_depth_or_default("12x", 7)).to_equal(7)
expect(parse_tree_depth_or_default("-4", 9)).to_equal(9)
```

</details>

#### returns the parsed depth for well-formed digits

- Verify: returns the parsed depth for well-formed digits
   - Expected: parse_tree_depth_or_default("42", 3) equals `42`
   - Expected: parse_tree_depth_or_default(" 8 ", 3) equals `8`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 4 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

