# @req: REQ-APP-TREE-001
step("Verify: returns the parsed depth for well-formed digits")
expect(parse_tree_depth_or_default("42", 3)).to_equal(42)
expect(parse_tree_depth_or_default(" 8 ", 3)).to_equal(8)
```

